# SpeedOf.Me

> SpeedOf.Me is a browser-based internet speed test for all devices, plus a developer platform: an embeddable JavaScript speed-test API and an npm package (@speedofme/mcp) that works as an MCP server, CLI, and SDK.

## About

SpeedOf.Me is a broadband speed test launched in December 2011. It measures download speed, upload speed, latency, and jitter using pure HTML5 and JavaScript, with no app or plugin to install. The same measurement engine is available to developers through a JavaScript API and the @speedofme/mcp npm package.

